  "prefLabel": "En 402.05 Competitive toll provider (CTP)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 402.05 “Competitive toll provider (CTP)” means any carrier authorized to provide intra local access and transport area (intraLATA) toll service, except for an ILEC-ELEC that provides toll service exclusively to its local service customers in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #14015, eff 7-1-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 400)",
